{"id":1110403,"name":"레비·심문 III","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"레비·심문 III","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1110403]}],"trial":{"trial_id":110403,"stage":"단계3","unlock_time":"2023-05-16 14:00:00","diary1":"그날 밤, 당신은 차드를 차에 태워 집에 데려다주기로 했다.","diary2":"레비가 당신을 속였다. 이제까지의 모든 행동은 단지 '재미를 위한 계획'이었을 뿐이다.\n　　하지만 당신은 그의 위선을 전부 들추어냈다. 레비는 자신이 말한 것처럼 전혀 관심이 없지는 않다. 허무주의에 빠진 사람이었다면 이렇게나 많은 쓸데없는 일을 벌이진 않았을 것이다. 어쩌면 레비에게 필요한 것은 과거 자신의 '가정'에서 얻지 못했던 조금의 관심과 사랑일지도 모른다.","evidence":[{"ID":260351,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260352,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":210403023,"next":null},{"step":24,"cours